{
 "_comment": "ComfyUI API-format workflow: FLUX.1-dev fp8 + ControlNet Union Pro 2.0 applied twice - depth pass (layout in space) then the lineart pass as an edge control (open framing such as joists reads as a grid underfoot, not a pergola). Placeholders in {{...}} are filled by generate_keyframe.py; edge strength 0 disables the second control.",
